{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/bd8a644601a4432f7c22228b77736a30.avif?t=1770821735\" width=780 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fantasy world inspired by the Classic of Mountains and Seas, merging the artistic conception of ink paintings with the texture of oil paintings. Explore five distinct regions\u2014mist-shrouded mountains, abandoned bamboo forest trails, desolate ancient ruins, and more. Fight monsters, bandits, and fallen humans twisted by obsession into demons. Collect mysterious bamboo slips and piece together the truth behind the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.poster.avif?t=1770821735\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.webm?t=1770821735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cc69ff81d346df2ee2e6538a932157c1.mp4?t=1770821735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/d27272f2c9840b77784ca3e5c0cfe067.avif?t=1770821735\" width=780 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your exploration team from 12 unique classes, including swordsmen, physicians, ritualists, drum warriors, and more. Utilize terrain, character traits, and skills to devise tactics against over 60 types of diverse enemies and over 10 bosses with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.poster.avif?t=1770821735\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.webm?t=1770821735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f3d3386f68b31ab0af5131a4ac482a3c.mp4?t=1770821735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat challenges not only your strategy but also your humanity. Knight-errants may grow stronger in desperate situations or flee due to mental collapse from fear. When a partner is lost in peril, will you risk total party wipe to rescue them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.poster.avif?t=1770821735\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.webm?t=1770821735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/b32027b2298dffddec9dd75df71ca30b.mp4?t=1770821735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/3ac14ab1286187d4fd62b0c66a044f20.avif?t=1770821735\" width=780 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, recover, develop, and recruit talents in your town. Construct various buildings and enlist legendary figures from the Spring and Autumn era: Lord Xinling, Wuji of Wei, helps you recruit heroes, the divine craftsman Ganjiang forges your weapons, and the strategic sage Guiguzi boosts overall morale. Further enhance your team's strength through sacrificial rituals and research, upgrade equipment, and prepare for the next journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/f7f9a50df07475740333659d171d1670.avif?t=1770821735\" width=1486 height=506 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201830?t=1770821735","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201830?t=1770821735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/ccc47197d6cb2c066c17fc011c6cc3b9ec0ebb19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770821735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/ccc47197d6cb2c066c17fc011c6cc3b9ec0ebb19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770821735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3565180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/bd8a644601a4432f7c22228b77736a30.avif?t=1770821735\" width=780 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fantasy world inspired by the Classic of Mountains and Seas, merging the artistic conception of ink paintings with the texture of oil paintings. Explore five distinct regions\u2014mist-shrouded mountains, abandoned bamboo forest trails, desolate ancient ruins, and more. Fight monsters, bandits, and fallen humans twisted by obsession into demons. Collect mysterious bamboo slips and pie